  ('Contemporary Literature 2', 12, 'G12-023', 'Review one’s interaction with digital literary texts, identifying strengths and areas for growth to cultivate new ways of thinking, imagining and expressing.', NULL, NULL, 'Reflecting on the impact and value of literature along one’s personal literary journey'),
